# Cursor Voice Harness

## Objective

Voice control of Cursor IDE Agent: OpenAI Realtime (local .env) + **extension Composer bridge** (primary) + optional desktop CLI fallback + hooks progress.

## Tasks

- [x] Phase 0: Desktop bridge scripts (optional; blocked when Statsig `desktop_bridge` off)
- [x] Phase 1: Extension HTTP bridge + hooks
- [x] Phase 1b: Extension `composerInstruct` path (no desktop CLI)
- [x] Phase 2: Local server `server/` — OpenAI `client_secrets`
- [x] Phase 3: Web WebRTC client
- [x] Phase 4: README, `.env.example`, `npm start`

## Guardrails

- No BrowserGPT / Nova gateway dependencies.
- OPENAI_API_KEY only in `.env` on the local server.
- Primary instruct: extension `submitComposerInstruction` → Cursor command IDs.
- Desktop CLI fallback only when extension unavailable.
